WEBVTT

00:00:08,720 --> 00:00:14,800
How do food allergies play into my cancer diet?

00:00:14,800 --> 00:00:17,360
We've had similar questions like this before,

00:00:17,360 --> 00:00:19,440
like, aren't when you're testing the cheek swab,

00:00:19,440 --> 00:00:21,720
are you testing for food allergies?

00:00:21,720 --> 00:00:24,800
The answer is no, we're not testing for food allergies.

00:00:24,800 --> 00:00:27,280
And no, when we put you on a cancer diet,

00:00:27,280 --> 00:00:29,800
it has nothing to do with food allergies whatsoever.

00:00:29,800 --> 00:00:32,640
It has to do with what's driving your cancer.

00:00:32,640 --> 00:00:35,440
So, oh, this would be a good question.

00:00:35,440 --> 00:00:39,040
Okay, you told me to stay off of dairy

00:00:39,200 --> 00:00:41,520
on my cheek swab test,

00:00:41,520 --> 00:00:44,120
but I might be in gluten free for years.

00:00:44,120 --> 00:00:46,560
Can I start eating gluten now?

00:00:46,560 --> 00:00:47,880
No, you can't.

00:00:47,880 --> 00:00:51,560
So if you went off gluten at some point in the past,

00:00:51,560 --> 00:00:55,320
it was maybe because you had a food sensitivity test

00:00:55,320 --> 00:00:57,760
or maybe because you had recommendations

00:00:57,760 --> 00:01:02,440
based on signs or symptoms that you had at that given time.

00:01:03,480 --> 00:01:08,480
So just because gluten is not driving my cancer,

00:01:09,280 --> 00:01:12,760
it doesn't mean I don't have food sensitivity to gluten.

00:01:12,760 --> 00:01:17,760
So how do food allergies play into my cancer diet?

00:01:17,760 --> 00:01:19,720
They're in addition to your cancer diet.

00:01:19,720 --> 00:01:21,240
So let's say you're off dairy

00:01:21,240 --> 00:01:24,880
because let's pretend you're off of dairy.

00:01:24,880 --> 00:01:26,800
Let's just keep it at that.

00:01:26,800 --> 00:01:28,520
That's a driver for your cancer.

00:01:28,520 --> 00:01:33,000
So you're on a low, you're on a no dairy diet.

00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:36,440
That doesn't mean that you shouldn't test for food allergies

00:01:36,440 --> 00:01:39,680
to see if you have any other source of inflammation

00:01:39,680 --> 00:01:41,680
that could be causing issues.

00:01:41,680 --> 00:01:45,880
So this would be a good reason for a cancer patient

00:01:45,880 --> 00:01:49,840
to run a Cyrex array three, array four,

00:01:49,840 --> 00:01:53,920
or an array 10 to test for,

00:01:53,920 --> 00:01:58,360
do you have antibodies to different foods?

00:01:58,360 --> 00:02:00,000
And if you're eating those foods

00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:01,880
that once you have antibodies against,

00:02:01,880 --> 00:02:03,480
you're going to cause inflammation

00:02:03,560 --> 00:02:06,880
and it's going to, is that going to feed your cancer?

00:02:06,880 --> 00:02:11,880
No, but it could indirectly hinder your healing

00:02:12,600 --> 00:02:17,600
because you're causing inflammation elsewhere.

00:02:18,480 --> 00:02:22,000
So your body's trying to kill cancer in your breast

00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:24,560
and every time you eat gluten,

00:02:24,560 --> 00:02:26,040
might not be driving your cancer

00:02:26,040 --> 00:02:28,160
but you're causing this inflammatory process

00:02:28,160 --> 00:02:29,440
of the gut and of the brain.

00:02:29,440 --> 00:02:31,040
Wherever any time you have inflammation

00:02:31,120 --> 00:02:33,720
in the gut equals inflammation of the brain.

00:02:33,720 --> 00:02:36,160
So you're causing this inflammatory cascade

00:02:36,160 --> 00:02:39,000
and it's taking away from the immune response

00:02:39,000 --> 00:02:42,600
that you want to be able to kill cancer cells in your breast.

00:02:42,600 --> 00:02:45,120
So that's why I've always said it can be valuable

00:02:45,120 --> 00:02:49,080
to run food antibody testing

00:02:50,760 --> 00:02:55,760
even though that isn't related to what's feeding your cancer

00:02:55,760 --> 00:03:01,480
per se, it can indirectly be hindering your ability to heal.

